  "title": "Emerald Holding, Inc. Appoints Vincenzo DiMaggio Chief Accounting Officer",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, NY – September 29, 2025 – Emerald Holding, Inc. (NYSE: EEX) a leader in building dynamic, market-driven business-to-business (B2B) events and media platforms, today announced the appointment of Vincenzo (“Vince”) DiMaggio as Chief Accounting Officer. In his new role, Vince brings more than 25 years of accounting leadership across both public and private […]",
